{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n車婉婉與樊亦敏在TVB節目《愛．回家之三代同糖》最新一集「玩命直播」中，上演一幕爆笑戲碼！二人以為事業迎來第二春，獲邀擔任直播主，豈料竟是誤墮騙局，被逼賣假貨。她們在直播期間更被要求大跳網絡洗腦神曲，最終索性豁出去，以瘋狂舞姿加走音歌喉搗亂直播，場面極度搞笑！\n</p>\n<h2>誤墮直播帶貨騙局 被逼賣假貨跳洗腦舞</h2>\n<p>劇情講述嘉冰（車婉婉飾）與龔喜（樊亦敏飾）以為被賞識，興奮地接受邀請做直播主，沒想到卻是墮入騙局，被幕後老闆Brain（唐嘉麟飾）威逼在鏡頭前推銷假貨。為了增加直播間的「娛樂性」，兩人更被要求即場大跳網絡上極度流行的「閃身步」與「狗熊哆嗦毛」，兩人面露難色又不敢反抗的模樣，已經充滿喜感，為之後的爆笑反擊埋下伏筆。</p>\n<h2>車婉婉樊亦敏絕地反擊 邊唱邊跳玩轉直播間</h2>\n<p>面對惡人威逼，車婉婉與樊亦敏在直播中途決定絕地反擊！她們索性將錯就錯，不但投入地跳起「閃身步」與「狗熊哆嗦毛」，更即興邊跳邊唱經典情歌《分分鐘需要你》，以騎呢舞姿配上五音不全的歌聲，成功將一場賣貨直播變成搗亂大會，爆笑度滿分。兩人完全豁出去的瘋狂演出，成功將騙徒的計劃徹底打亂，讓在場的壞人目瞪口呆，喜劇效果十足。</p>\n<h2>李偉健歐瑞偉睇直播覺唔妥 組隊急忙前往救人</h2>\n<p>就在車婉婉與樊亦敏在直播間「大暴走」的同時，她們的好友唐芯（李茵彤飾）、嘉聰（李偉健飾）及朱基（歐瑞偉飾）正在收看直播。他們憑著敏銳的觀察力，很快便察覺到直播氣氛不對勁，意識到嘉冰與龔喜可能身陷險境。三人見狀心急如焚，立即決定動身前往直播現場救人，為這段搞笑的劇情增添了一絲緊張的氣氛。</p>\n<h2>網民睇到笑爆肚 「呢part真係年度級爆笑」</h2>\n<p>車婉婉與樊亦敏的爆笑演出，成功引發網民熱議，不少觀眾表示看得捧腹大笑。有網民留言：「笑到我肚痛！婉婉同樊亦敏豁出去！」、「個閃身步同狗熊哆嗦毛跳得好有神髓！」許多觀眾都認為這一幕是近期劇集中的經典：「呢part真係年度級爆笑場面！」更有粉絲強烈要求重溫：「求下TVB放返呢段片上網，要loop爆佢！」。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/02_4964976976ae2db70ca6cc.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/02_4964976976ae2db70ca6cc.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/03_19179602366ae2db74a5d99.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/03_19179602366ae2db74a5d99.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/04_5278417156ae2db781db51.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/04_5278417156ae2db781db51.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/05_10019994526ae2db7b56254.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/05_10019994526ae2db7b56254.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/06_9324939946ae2db7ed9252.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/06_9324939946ae2db7ed9252.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/07_16738225466ae2db81cd773.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/07_16738225466ae2db81cd773.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/08_3526633196ae2db8532a10.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/08_3526633196ae2db8532a10.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/09_12842749746ae2db88b3be8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/09_12842749746ae2db88b3be8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/10_7089725276ae2db8c29761.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/10_7089725276ae2db8c29761.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/11_20328275446ae2db90317d1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/11_20328275446ae2db90317d1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/12_14907654396ae2db93664aa.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/12_14907654396ae2db93664aa.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/13_7625128446ae2db968f94c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/13_7625128446ae2db968f94c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/14_15017280896ae2db9b53433.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/14_15017280896ae2db9b53433.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/15_12421848146ae2db9e40883.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/15_12421848146ae2db9e40883.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/16_9583093386ae2dba0d2521.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/16_9583093386ae2dba0d2521.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17_2940267906ae2dba588eb0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17_2940267906ae2dba588eb0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T13:01:11.820072+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1217,"images":16,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T12:40:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T14:58:38.800668+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T12:58:39.308746+00:00","content_hash":"bf95b7c0938aaadb70e674af1893fe685bfa722163ca01874e229bc13557f3b5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}